Package: skiresultsR
Type: Package
Title: Extract and Analyze Ski Race Results
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Justin", "Townsend", , "justinjtownsend@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: A comprehensive R package for extracting and analyzing ski race results 
    from skiresults.co.uk HTML files. The package provides functions to parse HTML 
    files containing race results and convert them into structured data frames 
    for analysis and visualization.
